{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-clinical-decision-support","title":"博士临床研究 — AI 辅助临床决策支持","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/ai-clinical-decision-support","wordCount":2262,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士临床研究-ai-辅助临床决策支持\">博士临床研究 — AI 辅助临床决策支持</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>人工智能（AI）在临床决策支持（Clinical Decision Support, CDS）中的应用正从辅助诊断向治疗推荐、风险预测和患者管理全链条扩展。机器学习模型在医学影像识别、EHR 驱动的风险分层和多组学数据整合方面已展现出与专科医生相当甚至更优的性能。然而，从模型开发到临床部署之间存在巨大鸿沟——&quot;AI 临床转化峡谷&quot;——需要严格的临床验证、监管审批、工作流整合和持续监测。</p>\n<p>AI-CDS 的应用层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>诊断辅助</strong>：医学影像分类（皮肤镜、视网膜、病理切片），ECG 自动解读</li>\n<li><strong>风险预测</strong>：住院死亡率（如 APACHE/NEWS 的 AI 增强版）、再入院风险、败血症早期预警</li>\n<li><strong>治疗推荐</strong>：药物选择优化（如肿瘤分子肿瘤板辅助）、个体化化疗方案</li>\n<li><strong>临床试验匹配</strong>：NLP 驱动的患者-试验自动匹配</li>\n<li><strong>运营决策</strong>：床位管理、手术排程、资源调度</li>\n</ul>\n<p>AI 模型在临床场景中面临的核心挑战与传统统计模型不同——不仅需要高预测精度，更需要临床可解释性、算法公平性、对数据分布漂移的鲁棒性，以及在真实临床工作流中的可操作性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[模型开发] --&gt; B[回顾性验证&lt;br/&gt;内部+外部]&#10;    B --&gt; C[前瞻性验证&lt;br/&gt;沉默模式]&#10;    C --&gt; D[临床效用试验&lt;br/&gt;RCT/Stepped Wedge]&#10;    D --&gt; E[监管审批&lt;br/&gt;FDA SaMD]&#10;    E --&gt; F[部署与监测&lt;br/&gt;漂移检测+再训练]&#10;    F --&gt;|性能下降| B\">graph TD\n    A[模型开发] --&gt; B[回顾性验证&lt;br/&gt;内部+外部]\n    B --&gt; C[前瞻性验证&lt;br/&gt;沉默模式]\n    C --&gt; D[临床效用试验&lt;br/&gt;RCT/Stepped Wedge]\n    D --&gt; E[监管审批&lt;br/&gt;FDA SaMD]\n    E --&gt; F[部署与监测&lt;br/&gt;漂移检测+再训练]\n    F --&gt;|性能下降| B</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"预测模型的临床验证层级\">预测模型的临床验证层级</h3><p>AI 临床预测模型的验证分为四个递进层级，与药物开发的 I-IV 期类比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术验证</td>\n<td>算法在开发数据上的性能</td>\n<td>交叉验证、自举</td>\n<td>AUC, calibration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回顾性临床验证</td>\n<td>外部数据集上的泛化性</td>\n<td>外部验证队列（不同机构/时期）</td>\n<td>时间验证、地理验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前瞻性临床验证</td>\n<td>真实环境中的实时性能</td>\n<td>沉默模式部署（模型运行但不影响决策）</td>\n<td>预测 vs. 实际结局对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临床效用验证</td>\n<td>使用 AI 是否改善患者结局</td>\n<td>RCT 或准实验设计</td>\n<td>净重分类改善（NRI）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>外部验证的关键原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>时间验证</strong>：用开发后时间段的数据测试（检测时间漂移）</li>\n<li><strong>地理验证</strong>：不同医疗机构的数据（检测机构间异质性）</li>\n<li><strong>人群验证</strong>：不同人口统计学特征的亚群（检测公平性）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>性能指标不应仅报告区分度（AUC），还需包括校准度（calibration）——即预测概率与实际发生率的一致性。Hosmer-Lemeshow 检验和校准曲线是标准工具。对于决策应用，净获益（Net Benefit）和决策曲线分析（DCA）更具临床意义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">NB(p_t) = \\frac{TP}{N} - \\frac{FP}{N} \\cdot \\frac{p_t}{1-p_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是采取行动的阈值概率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可解释性方法\">可解释性方法</h3><p>临床环境对模型可解释性有刚性需求——医生需要理解&quot;为什么模型做出这个预测&quot;才能决定是否采纳。主要方法分为两类：</p>\n<p><strong>内在可解释模型</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>临床适用性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逻辑回归</td>\n<td>系数直接解释为对数优势比</td>\n<td>风险评分卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评分系统</td>\n<td>整数化的特征权重相加</td>\n<td>CURB-65, SOFA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释增强机 (EBM)</td>\n<td>每个特征的边际效应可视化</td>\n<td>保留可解释性同时接近复杂模型性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策树/规则列表</td>\n<td>显式的 if-then 规则链</td>\n<td>临床路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>事后解释方法</strong>（用于复杂黑箱模型）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）</strong>：基于博弈论 Shapley 值，为每个预测分解各特征的贡献</li>\n<li><strong>LIME（Local Interpretable Model-agnostic Explanations）</strong>：用局部线性模型近似黑箱模型在特定输入附近的行为</li>\n<li><strong>注意力权重可视化</strong>：在 Transformer 模型中展示输入 token 的注意力分布</li>\n<li><strong>反事实解释</strong>：回答&quot;如果这个特征改变了，预测会如何变化？&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SHAP 值的加性性质使其特别适合临床解释：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x) = \\phi_0 + \\sum_{j=1}^{M} \\phi_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.417em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基线预测，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的贡献。</p>\n<h3 id=\"算法公平性与偏见审计\">算法公平性与偏见审计</h3><p>AI 模型可能放大训练数据中的系统性偏见，导致对特定人群的不公平预测。经典案例包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>种族偏倚的医疗费用预测模型</strong>：使用医疗支出作为&quot;健康需求&quot;的代理变量，由于黑人群体在同等疾病负担下获得的医疗支出更少，模型系统性地低估了黑人群体的健康需求（Obermeyer et al., Science 2019）</li>\n<li><strong>皮肤病 AI 在深色皮肤上的性能下降</strong>：训练数据中深色皮肤图像不足导致</li>\n</ul>\n<p>公平性的定量指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>统计平等</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\hat{Y}=1 \\vert A=0) = P(\\hat{Y}=1 \\vert A=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正预测率跨群体相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机会均等</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretch